{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NxvGhabEvvX48ym8jM1VeM","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_18/projects/schema-dag-extraction/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-15\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp003a_prompt_v2_rerun** (success): —\\\\n- **exp-004** (success): —\\\\n  [ACE05 Data Prep Report](/api/workspace-files/projects/schema-dag-extraction/artifacts/exp-004/report/ace05_data_prep_report.md) | [ace05_entity_types.json](/api/workspace-files/projects/schema-dag-extraction/artifacts/exp-004/data/ace05_entity_types.json) | [ace05_relation_types.json](/api/workspace-files/projects/schema-dag-extraction/artifacts/exp-004/data/ace05_relation_types.json) | [preprocess_ace05.py](/api/workspace-files/projects/schema-dag-extraction/artifacts/exp-004/intermediate/preprocess_ace05.py) | [compute_type_embeddings.py](/api/workspace-files/projects/schema-dag-extraction/artifacts/exp-004/intermediate/compute_type_embeddings.py) | [MAVEN SCS Matrix](/api/workspace-files/projects/schema-dag-extraction/artifacts/exp-004/data/maven_scs_artifacts.txt) | [MAVEN vs Few-NERD SCS Comparison Report](/api/workspace-files/projects/schema-dag-extraction/artifacts/exp-004/report/exp004_maven_scs_report.md)\\\\n- **exp002_confusability_controlled** (success): —\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 4 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 4\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\ncqa1-38874: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1253, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015FnrvQskGxtnXQwLSDytkq","session_id":"5eba5149-decb-42fd-9375-14d22c483592","uuid":"56657375-bdff-4e7e-a942-187f1e768014","timestamp":"2026-05-15T06:20:02.691Z"}
